WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.102
Ellen and the prince swam for hours.

2
00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:11.976
They dived and floated.

3
00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:25.977
They played games underwater.

4
00:00:25.978 --> 00:00:30.143
Then the moon began to rise, and they heard voices.

5
00:00:30.144 --> 00:00:33.884
Lights shined through the woods.

6
00:00:33.885 --> 00:00:38.216
"The servants are coming for me," Ellen whispered.

7
00:00:38.217 --> 00:00:41.512
"Too bad because this is delightful."

8
00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:43.132
The prince nodded.

9
00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:48.541
"Swimming with you makes me so happy! Can we meet again?"

10
00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:52.067
"Perhaps." She looked away.

11
00:00:52.068 --> 00:00:59.495
"But it's not proper to meet alone. We must keep our meetings a secret."

12
00:00:59.496 --> 00:01:03.646
"Of course," the prince said.

13
00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:11.715
He slipped out of the lake and disappeared into the dark woods.

14
00:01:11.716 --> 00:01:16.643
Early the next morning, the prince returned to the lake.

15
00:01:16.644 --> 00:01:19.468
The princess was already swimming.

16
00:01:19.469 --> 00:01:22.386
The prince longed to join her.

17
00:01:22.387 --> 00:01:25.248
But her parents were with her.

18
00:01:25.249 --> 00:01:30.482
They were in a beautiful boat, drifting on the lake.

19
00:01:30.483 --> 00:01:36.052
"You must wait," he reminded himself, thinking of their secret.

20
00:01:36.053 --> 00:01:44.962
Finally, by late afternoon, Ellen was alone at the lake.

21
00:01:44.963 --> 00:01:49.135
The prince found a tall rock and climbed up.

22
00:01:49.136 --> 00:02:00.420
He began to sing.

23
00:02:00.421 --> 00:02:12.064
Ellen swam over, floating below him.

24
00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:15.839
"You have a lovely voice!"

25
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:21.784
He blushed. "Thank you. Would you like to fall into the water with me again?"

26
00:02:21.785 --> 00:02:29.254
"Yes!" Her blue eyes twinkled. "You must pull me up there first."

27
00:02:29.255 --> 00:02:33.066
The prince took off his scarf and belt and tied them together.

28
00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:36.073
Then he let them down like a rope.

29
00:02:36.074 --> 00:02:43.285
She grabbed on, and he pulled her up to the rock.

30
00:02:43.286 --> 00:02:49.687
They held hands and leaped into the water together.

31
00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:57.264
Ellen laughed with delight. "What fun!"

32
00:02:57.265 --> 00:02:59.580
Day after day the pair met.

33
00:02:59.581 --> 00:03:04.927
They swam in the lake and talked about everything.

34
00:03:04.928 --> 00:03:07.627
The prince was falling in love.

35
00:03:07.628 --> 00:03:14.229
Ellen was beautiful, and she made him so happy.

36
00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.737
He tried to share his feelings with her.

37
00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:21.494
But she just laughed at him.

38
00:03:21.495 --> 00:03:26.885
"I'm serious, Ellen," he said.

39
00:03:26.886 --> 00:03:33.644
She laughed louder and swam away.

40
00:03:33.645 --> 00:03:40.950
The prince sighed and swam after her.

41
00:03:40.951 --> 00:03:47.356
As time went on, the prince saw that Ellen was always lighthearted.

42
00:03:47.357 --> 00:03:50.732
He realized something else too.

43
00:03:50.733 --> 00:03:56.433
She was happiest in the water.

44
00:03:56.434 --> 00:03:59.619
"Someday I will marry her," he thought.

45
00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:10.392
"But we will have to turn into a mermaid and a merman!"

